# Trivy ignore rules — build-tool dependencies not present in runtime artifacts
#
# These CVEs affect tar@6.2.1, a transitive dependency of @expo/cli@0.18.31
# (Expo SDK 51 toolchain). tar is used exclusively during local builds and CI
# (expo prebuild, expo install). It is NOT bundled into:
#   - The Android APK delivered to users
#   - The Vercel web bundle
#   - Any production runtime
#
# Exploitation requires either:
#   (a) A supply-chain compromise of the Expo CDN or npm registry
#   (b) The developer machine already being compromised
#
# Risk accepted as: build-tool only, no runtime exposure, no public exploit.
# Re-evaluate if Expo SDK 51 is upgraded or if a runtime tar dependency is introduced.
#
# Reviewed: 2026-05-06 | Branch: fix/security-expo-cli-tar-chain

# tar@6.2.1 via @expo/cli@0.18.31 (Expo SDK 51 build toolchain)
